==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{af|ru|по-|дели́ть}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|подели́ть}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-поделить.ogg}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|подели́ть|pf|impf=дели́ть}}

# to [[share]]
#: {{uxi|ru|[[они|Они́]] [[решить|реши́ли]] '''подели́ть''' [[комната|ко́мнату]].|They decided to share the room. (Depending on context, this could be understood that they decided to divide the room in ex. halves.)}}
# to [[divide]] up
#: {{uxi|ru|[[они|Они́]] [[решить|реши́ли]] '''подели́ть''' [[добыча|добы́чу]].|They decided to divide the catch between themselves.}}
# to [[deal]] well with [[someone]] (usually used with the negative particle)
#: {{uxi|ru|[[отчего|Отчего́]] и́м [[не́]] подели́ть?|Why wouldn't they deal well with each other?}}

====Conjugation====
{{ru-conj|pf|4c(7)|подели́ть}}
